\newlabel{fig:7.7}{{7.7}{144}{Pure VAE baseline ROC curve at the 5\% FPR operating point. The ROC trajectory (AUC = 0.550) with the operating point marked at FPR = 0.050, TPR = 0.099 confirms the limited discriminative capacity of the standalone unsupervised model. The near-diagonal shape indicates that the VAE reconstruction error alone provides minimal separation between legitimate and fraudulent transactions}{figure.caption.100}{}}
